<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n35922" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐνοικο͂δομέω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>build in</i> a place, [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῇ νήσῳ] πύργον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					3.51
				</span></i>
			; [
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇ Αακωνικῇ] τείχισμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					8.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θύρετρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>BCH</u>
					6.24
				</span></i>
			 (Delos, <span class="entity">ii B. C.</span>):—
				Pass.
			, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τῇ Μιλήτῳ φρούριον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					8.84
				</span></i>
			:—
				Med.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. τεῖχος</span>
			<i>build oneself</i> a fort <i>there,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				3.85
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>build up, block up,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς θύρας τῶν οἰκιῶν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PPetr.</u>
					2p.28
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυρίδα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arr.
					<u>An.</u>
					6.29.10
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εἴσοδον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					11.45
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πυλίδα τινὰ ἐνῳκοδομημένην</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Th.
					6.51
				</span></i>
			 (or perh. <i>built into</i> the wall), cf. <i><span class="en">
				Polyaen.
				1.40.4
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φάραγξ -μημένη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.S.
					3.37
				</span></i>
			.</div>
